config:
  sequence:
    rightAngles: true
    actorMargin: 65
    wrap: true
---
sequenceDiagram
 participant P0 as Browser
 participant P1 as Django / DRF
 participant P2 as PostgreSQL
 participant P3 as Redis
 participant P4 as Celery Worker
 participant P5 as FastAPI
 P0->>P1: POST /api/analyses/ · MP4 / IP Webcam
 P1->>P2: AnalysisJob 생성 · PENDING
 P1->>P3: enqueue(Job ID)
 P1->>P0: HTTP 202 + Job ID
 P3->>P4: 작업 전달
 P4->>P2: STARTED
 P4->>P4: MP4 읽기 또는 IP Webcam 수집
 P4->>P5: predict_video() · MP4
 P5->>P5: YOLO Pose → Feature → RF
 P5->>P4: Track ID · Action · Confidence
 alt 처리 성공
  P4->>P2: SUCCESS · 예측 / 조건부 행동 저장
 else 처리 실패
  P4->>P2: FAILURE · 오류 코드 저장
 end
 loop 종료 상태까지 2초 간격
  P0->>P1: GET /api/analyses/{id}/status/
  P1->>P2: 본인 작업 ORM 조회
  P2->>P1: 상태 · 예측 · 기록
  P1->>P0: 결과 JSON
 end
